<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/signal#sampleRate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The number of sample instants per second for a sampled signal, expressed in hertz. Channel count is separate; a multi-channel sample instant is not multiplied by its number of channels."@en .
